  "description": "Use when drafting or revising the 中文摘要 or 英文 abstract for a 《财贸经济》(Finance & Trade Economics, CTE) manuscript — the CSSCI 财经权威期刊 run by 中国社会科学院财经战略研究院. 当摘要写成\"为高质量发展提供新思路\"式套话、缺核心数据 / 识别策略 / 量化发现、或中英文语义不对齐时使用。Enforces the five-sentence pattern, requires quantified findings with named data sources (CSMAR / WIND / CEIC / 统计年鉴), and forbids empty-significance phrases.",
